---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Bonfire — Community
description: Bonfire isn't a product with users, it's a commons with participants. However much you've got, there's a way in.
---

{% set eyebrow = "flex items-center gap-3 font-smono text-[1rem] font-bold tracking-[.18em] uppercase" %}
{% set display = "mt-4 font-disp font-[620] text-[clamp(1.6rem,3vw,2.3rem)] leading-[1.06] tracking-[-.02em] text-balance" %}
{% set bodyp = "mt-3.5 text-[1.02rem] text-ink-2 max-w-[42rem]" %}
{% set golink = "mt-auto pt-3 font-smono text-[.72rem] tracking-[.05em] uppercase text-spark hover:underline" %}
{% set btnfire = "btn h-auto min-h-0 rounded-full border-0 px-5 py-[.8rem] font-smono text-[.78rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[.05em] text-[#221302] bg-gradient-to-br from-spark via-flame to-ember hover:from-spark hover:via-flame hover:to-ember shadow-[0_6px_26px_-8px_rgba(232,145,43,.55)]" %}
{% set btnline = "btn btn-ghost h-auto min-h-0 rounded-full px-5 py-[.8rem] font-smono text-[.78rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[.05em] text-ink border border-ink/15 bg-ink/[0.03] hover:border-flame hover:text-spark hover:bg-ink/[0.03]" %}

<div class="relative overflow-x-clip bg-night text-ink font-body leading-[1.55] antialiased selection:bg-ember selection:text-[#160c02]">
  <div class="v2-ambient" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="relative z-[1]">

    {# hero + intent router #}
    <header class="py-24">
    <div class="max-w-[1180px] w-full mx-auto px-7">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-6">
        <div>
          <p class="{{ eyebrow }} text-flame">Community</p>
          <h1 class="mt-5 max-w-[11ch] font-disp font-[620] text-[clamp(3.35rem,7.4vw,6rem)] leading-[.94] tracking-[-.035em] text-balance">Find your way <span class="italic font-medium text-flame">in.</span></h1>
        </div>
        <p class="max-w-[36rem] pb-1 text-[clamp(1.05rem,1.6vw,1.28rem)] leading-[1.55] text-ink-2">However much you've got — an hour or a year — there's a way to take part. Come to listen, lend a hand, bring your community, or sustain the care work.</p>
      </div>

      {# <nav aria-label="Choose how to participate" class="grid grid-cols-1 min-[601px]:grid-cols-2 min-[901px]:grid-cols-4 gap-px mt-[clamp(2.5rem,5vw,4.5rem)] rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-ink/15 bg-ink/15">
        <a class="group flex min-h-[15.5rem] flex-col gap-2 bg-night px-[22px] py-[26px] transition-[background-color] duration-200 hover:bg-night-2 focus-visible:z-10 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-[-2px] focus-visible:outline-flame" href="#gather">
          <span class="font-smono text-[.64rem] tracking-[.11em] uppercase text-ink-3">No commitment</span>
          <h2 class="font-disp font-[620] text-[1.28rem] text-flame">Hang out</h2>
          <p class="text-ink-2 text-[.94rem] m-0">Come see what it's like. Lurk in the chat, poke at the campground, follow along.</p>
          <span class="{{ golink }} transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:translate-x-1">Where we gather →</span>
        </a>
        <a class="group flex min-h-[15.5rem] flex-col gap-2 bg-night px-[22px] py-[26px] transition-[background-color] duration-200 hover:bg-night-2 focus-visible:z-10 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-[-2px] focus-visible:outline-leaf" href="#help">
          <span class="font-smono text-[.64rem] tracking-[.11em] uppercase text-ink-3">An hour or an afternoon</span>
          <h2 class="font-disp font-[620] text-[1.28rem] text-leaf">Help out</h2>
          <p class="text-ink-2 text-[.94rem] m-0">Translate a screen, file a bug, fix a good first issue, improve the docs.</p>
          <span class="{{ golink }} transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:translate-x-1">Ways to help →</span>
        </a>
        <a class="group flex min-h-[15.5rem] flex-col gap-2 bg-night px-[22px] py-[26px] transition-[background-color] duration-200 hover:bg-night-2 focus-visible:z-10 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-[-2px] focus-visible:outline-spark" href="#organize">
          <span class="font-smono text-[.64rem] tracking-[.11em] uppercase text-ink-3">Ongoing</span>
          <h2 class="font-disp font-[620] text-[1.28rem] text-spark">Shape it</h2>
          <p class="text-ink-2 text-[.94rem] m-0">Bring a real need from a real community, and co-design what's missing with us.</p>
          <span class="{{ golink }} transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:translate-x-1">Bring your community →</span>
        </a>
        <a class="group flex min-h-[15.5rem] flex-col gap-2 bg-night px-[22px] py-[26px] transition-[background-color] duration-200 hover:bg-night-2 focus-visible:z-10 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-[-2px] focus-visible:outline-corn" href="#support">
          <span class="font-smono text-[.64rem] tracking-[.11em] uppercase text-ink-3">Whatever you can</span>
          <h2 class="font-disp font-[620] text-[1.28rem] text-corn">Sustain it</h2>
          <p class="text-ink-2 text-[.94rem] m-0">Fund the unglamorous work: maintenance, care, and the people who do it.</p>
          <span class="{{ golink }} transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:translate-x-1">Support the care →</span>
        </a>
      </nav> #}
    </div></header>

    {# where we gather #}
    <section id="gather" class="py-16 border-t border-ink/[0.07] scroll-mt-[70px]">
    <div class="max-w-[1180px] mx-auto px-7">
      <p class="{{ eyebrow }} text-corn">Where we gather</p>
      <h2 class="{{ display }} max-w-[20ch]">Three rooms, all of them <span class="italic font-medium">open.</span></h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 min-[821px]:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mt-[26px]">
        <div class="card rounded-xl border border-ink/15 bg-night-2 px-[22px] py-6 gap-2">
          <span class="font-smono text-[.66rem] tracking-[.1em] uppercase text-corn">The workshop</span>
          <h3 class="font-disp font-[620] text-[1.1rem]">Matrix chat</h3>
          <p class="text-ink-2 text-[.93rem] m-0">Day-to-day talk: questions, half-formed ideas, what people are working on. The easiest door: just say hello.</p>
          <a class="{{ golink }}" href="https://matrix.to/#/%23bonfire-networks:matrix.org">Join the chat →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="card rounded-xl border border-ink/15 bg-night-2 px-[22px] py-6 gap-2">
          <span class="font-smono text-[.66rem] tracking-[.1em] uppercase text-corn">The playground</span>
          <h3 class="font-disp font-[620] text-[1.1rem]">The campground</h3>
          <p class="text-ink-2 text-[.93rem] m-0">Our open test instance. Make an account, break things, tell us what felt wrong. Data gets reset now and then, don't move in.</p>
          <a class="{{ golink }}" href="https://campground.bonfire.cafe/">Sign up on the campground →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="card rounded-xl border border-ink/15 bg-night-2 px-[22px] py-6 gap-2">
          <span class="font-smono text-[.66rem] tracking-[.1em] uppercase text-corn">The square</span>
          <h3 class="font-disp font-[620] text-[1.1rem]">The fediverse</h3>
          <p class="text-ink-2 text-[.93rem] m-0">Where we post news, share what we're building, and argue in public. Follow, reply, boost.</p>
          <a class="{{ golink }}" href="https://bonfire.cafe/@Bonfire">Follow @Bonfire →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div></section>

    {# ways to help #}
    <section id="help" class="py-16 border-t border-ink/[0.07] scroll-mt-[70px]">
    <div class="max-w-[1180px] mx-auto px-7">
      <p class="{{ eyebrow }} text-flame">Ways to help</p>
      <h2 class="{{ display }} max-w-[24ch]">Small things count. <span class="italic font-medium">Most of Bonfire is small things.</span></h2>
      {% set ct = "card rounded-xl border border-ink/15 px-[19px] py-5 gap-[7px] hover:border-ink/25" %}
      {% set cttime = "badge h-auto self-start rounded-full bg-transparent border-ink/15 px-2 py-[3px] font-smono text-[.63rem] tracking-[.1em] uppercase text-ink-3" %}
      {% set cth = "font-disp font-[620] text-[1.05rem] mt-1" %}
      {% set ctp = "text-ink-2 text-[.91rem] m-0" %}
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 min-[621px]:grid-cols-2 min-[901px]:grid-cols-3 gap-3.5 mt-[26px]">
        <div class="{{ ct }} border-leaf/40 bg-leaf/[0.04]">
          {# <span class="{{ cttime }} text-leaf border-leaf/40">★ Start here · an afternoon</span> #}
          <h3 class="{{ cth }}">Fix a good first issue</h3>
          <p class="{{ ctp }}">We keep a list of small, well-described tasks specifically for newcomers to the codebase.</p>
          <a class="{{ golink }}" href="https://github.com/bonfire-networks/bonfire-app/issues?q=is%3Aissue+is%3Aopen+label%3A%22Good+first+issue%22">Browse good first issues →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="{{ ct }}">
          {# <span class="{{ cttime }}">30 minutes</span> #}
          <h3 class="{{ cth }}">Translate a screen</h3>
          <p class="{{ ctp }}">Bonfire speaks English, Italian, French and Catalan. If yours is missing, you can fix that.</p>
          <a class="{{ golink }}" href="https://explore.transifex.com/bonfire/bonfire/">Translate on Transifex →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="{{ ct }}">
          {# <span class="{{ cttime }}">10 minutes</span> #}
          <h3 class="{{ cth }}">Report what broke</h3>
          <p class="{{ ctp }}">Something felt wrong, confusing, or inaccessible? That's a bug. Tell us, especially the small annoyances.</p>
          <a class="{{ golink }}" href="https://github.com/bonfire-networks/bonfire-app/issues/new/choose">Open an issue →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="{{ ct }}">
          {# <span class="{{ cttime }}">An evening</span> #}
          <h3 class="{{ cth }}">Write code</h3>
          <p class="{{ ctp }}">Elixir, Phoenix, LiveView. Set up a local environment from the docs and dig into an extension.</p>
          <a class="{{ golink }}" href="https://github.com/bonfire-networks/bonfire-app">Read the dev docs →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="{{ ct }}">
          {# <span class="{{ cttime }}">An hour</span> #}
          <h3 class="{{ cth }}">Improve the docs</h3>
          <p class="{{ ctp }}">If something confused you, it'll confuse the next person. Writing it down is a real contribution.</p>
          <a class="{{ golink }}" href="https://github.com/bonfire-networks/bonfire-app/issues/new/choose">Suggest a doc fix →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="{{ ct }}">
          {# <span class="{{ cttime }}">Ongoing</span> #}
          <h3 class="{{ cth }}">Propose an idea</h3>
          <p class="{{ ctp }}">A feature, a better flow, a challenge to an assumption we've made. We'd rather be argued with early.</p>
          <a class="{{ golink }}" href="https://github.com/bonfire-networks/bonfire-app/issues/new/choose">Open a proposal →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div></section>

    {# bring your community #}
    <section id="organize" class="py-16 border-t border-ink/[0.07] scroll-mt-[70px]">
    <div class="max-w-[1180px] mx-auto px-7">
      <p class="{{ eyebrow }} text-flame">Bring your community</p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 min-[881px]:grid-cols-[1.15fr_.85fr] gap-6 min-[881px]:gap-10 items-center mt-[26px] rounded-xl border border-ink/15 px-8 py-[34px]">
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-disp font-[620] text-2xl mb-2.5">Got a community that needs a home?</h3>
          <p class="text-ink-2 text-base mb-[18px] max-w-[38rem]">This is the contribution we value most. Co-ops, collectives, unions, newsrooms, research groups, care networks... come tell us how you actually work, and we'll shape a space around it together. Everything we build with you goes back into the commons, for whoever needs it next.</p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-[11px]">
            <a class="{{ btnfire }}" href="https://cal.com/bonfire-networks/meet">Let's chat</a>
            <a class="{{ btnline }}" href="/case-studies">See how others did it →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <img src="/img/jacobin/j10-boundary-presets.png" alt="A co-design workshop with a community" class="w-full rounded-xl border border-ink/15 object-cover min-h-[14rem] max-h-[22rem]">
        {# <div class="w-full aspect-video rounded-xl border border-dashed border-ink/15 flex items-center justify-center text-center font-smono text-[.72rem] text-ink-3 leading-[1.6] bg-[repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,transparent_0_22px,rgba(242,236,219,.022)_22px_44px)]"><span class="max-w-[30ch]"><span class="text-flame">[ SHOT ]</span><br>a co-design workshop / community session</span></div> #}
      </div>
    </div></section>

    {# support the care work #}
    <section id="support" class="py-16 border-t border-ink/[0.07] scroll-mt-[70px]">
    <div class="max-w-[1180px] mx-auto px-7">
      <p class="{{ eyebrow }} text-flame">Support the care work</p>
      <h2 class="{{ display }} max-w-[24ch]">Fund the unglamorous part. <span class="italic font-medium">It's the part that keeps it alive.</span></h2>
      <p class="{{ bodyp }}">Most funders want to pay for the new and shiny. Almost no one wants to pay for maintenance, like fixing bugs, answering questions, keeping things usable on old phones and slow connections, moderating, translating. That work is what makes software trustworthy. It's what your money buys here.</p>

      {# stats — update from Open Collective (or wire to _data at build time) #}
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 min-[521px]:grid-cols-2 min-[901px]:grid-cols-4 gap-px mt-[26px] rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-ink/15 bg-ink/15">
        {% set oc = [
          { n: "33", l: "Backers", s: "People and orgs chipping in." },
          { n: "€888", l: "Income, past year", s: "That's the whole community chest." },
          { n: "€439", l: "In the collective now", s: "Every euro in and out is public." },
          { n: "3", l: "Monthly supporters", s: "Recurring gifts we can actually plan around." }
        ] %}
        {% for o in oc %}
        <div class="bg-night-2 px-[22px] py-6">
          <div class="font-disp font-bold text-[1.9rem] leading-none tracking-[-.02em] text-flame">{{ o.n }}</div>
          <div class="mt-2 font-smono text-[.66rem] tracking-[.1em] uppercase text-ink-3">{{ o.l }}</div>
          <div class="mt-1.5 text-[.84rem] text-ink-2">{{ o.s }}</div>
        </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>

      {# <div class="mt-[26px] border-l-2 border-flame pl-[22px]">
        <p class="font-disp font-medium italic text-[clamp(1.1rem,2.1vw,1.45rem)] leading-[1.3] m-0">“Thirty-three people fund the maintenance of software used by thousands. That's the honest picture, and it's why one more backer genuinely changes it.”</p>
      </div> #}
      <h2 class="{{ display }} max-w-[24ch] mt-[34px]">Donate</h2>

      {% set tier = "card rounded-xl border border-ink/15 px-5 py-[22px] gap-[7px]" %}
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 min-[561px]:grid-cols-2 min-[901px]:grid-cols-4 gap-3.5 mt-[26px]">
        <div class="{{ tier }}">
          <div class="font-disp font-bold text-[1.45rem]">€3</div><div class="font-smono text-[.64rem] tracking-[.1em] uppercase text-ink-3">a month</div>
          <p class="text-ink-2 text-[.9rem] mt-1.5 m-0">Keeps a translation up to date, so someone reads Bonfire in their own language.</p>
          <a class="{{ golink }}" href="https://opencollective.com/bonfire-networks">Back it →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="{{ tier }} border-flame/60 bg-flame/5">
          <div class="font-disp font-bold text-[1.45rem] text-flame">€6</div><div class="font-smono text-[.64rem] tracking-[.1em] uppercase text-ink-3">a month · most chosen</div>
          <p class="text-ink-2 text-[.9rem] mt-1.5 m-0">An hour of the unglamorous work: a bug fixed, a question answered, docs unstuck.</p>
          <a class="{{ golink }}" href="https://opencollective.com/bonfire-networks">Back it →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="{{ tier }}">
          <div class="font-disp font-bold text-[1.45rem]">€12</div><div class="font-smono text-[.64rem] tracking-[.1em] uppercase text-ink-3">a month</div>
          <p class="text-ink-2 text-[.9rem] mt-1.5 m-0">Helps us slow a release when someone's ill or burnt out, instead of pushing through.</p>
          <a class="{{ golink }}" href="https://opencollective.com/bonfire-networks">Back it →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="{{ tier }}">
          <div class="font-disp font-bold text-[1.45rem]">Any</div><div class="font-smono text-[.64rem] tracking-[.1em] uppercase text-ink-3">one-off</div>
          <p class="text-ink-2 text-[.9rem] mt-1.5 m-0">Or fund a specific feature, a circle, or a co-design sprint with your community.</p>
          <a class="{{ golink }}" href="https://cal.com/bonfire-networks/meet">Let's chat →</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid gap-3.5 mt-[34px]">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr] gap-3.5">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 mt-[7px] bg-flame [clip-path:polygon(50%_0,100%_50%,50%_100%,0_50%)]" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <div><b class="font-disp font-semibold block mb-0.5">Maintenance first</b><span class="text-ink-2 text-[.95rem]">We made care and maintenance the condition of our crowdfunder's success, before any exciting stretch goal.</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr] gap-3.5">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 mt-[7px] bg-flame [clip-path:polygon(50%_0,100%_50%,50%_100%,0_50%)]" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <div><b class="font-disp font-semibold block mb-0.5">Radically transparent</b><span class="text-ink-2 text-[.95rem]">Every expense is public on Open Collective, fiscally hosted by Open Source Europe. You can see exactly where it goes.</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr] gap-3.5">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 mt-[7px] bg-flame [clip-path:polygon(50%_0,100%_50%,50%_100%,0_50%)]" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <div><b class="font-disp font-semibold block mb-0.5">No VC, no ads, nothing to sell</b><span class="text-ink-2 text-[.95rem]">Community-funded means no one can buy us and turn Bonfire against you later.</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="{{ eyebrow }} text-flame mt-10">The 33 who already do</p>
      <p class="mt-3 text-[.96rem] text-ink-2 max-w-[42rem]">Listed alphabetically. No tiers, no top donors, no gold badges — a commons doesn't rank the people who keep it alive.</p>
